1
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,360
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:27,760
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,640
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:35,360
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:39,040
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,720
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:48,400
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,720
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,601
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,601 --> 00:00:59,480
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 3=

12
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:05,880
(Chunya Teahouse)

13
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:06,840
Your Highness,

14
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:08,280
what does Feng Weiyue even mean by this?

15
00:01:08,719 --> 00:01:10,559
She said she'd return the 1,000 taels
you lent her yesterday,

16
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,400
and she picked this place?

17
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,239
This teahouse is run by His Highness.

18
00:01:14,239 --> 00:01:15,440
Talking about repaying on our own turf,

19
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:17,000
I suspect she's trying to be sarcastic.

20
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:21,079
Then let's see what she's really up to.

21
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:24,239
Feng Weiyue,

22
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,840
what exactly do you mean?

23
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,599
Why did you suddenly create
an opportunity for me

24
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:30,119
and ask me to bring 1,000 taels?

25
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:31,639
Oh, come on.

26
00:01:31,639 --> 00:01:33,360
A mere 1,000 taels

27
00:01:33,519 --> 00:01:35,519
shouldn't be much for you.

28
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:37,840
I promise I'll make every tael worth it.

29
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:39,079
In a moment,

30
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:40,760
you'll take this 1,000 taels

31
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:43,039
and show up in front of Mo Yuya.

32
00:01:43,039 --> 00:01:45,920
Tell him this is all you have,

33
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:48,400
and that you're paying off my debt.

34
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,519
This really is all I have.

35
00:01:50,639 --> 00:01:52,480
Even better. More convincing.

36
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,840
Trust me.

37
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,400
No man can resist

38
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:59,599
such a brave, unwavering confession
from his first love.

39
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:01,960
(Chunya Teahouse)
Go on.

40
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:02,760
Hmm.

41
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,400
You got this.

42
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,239
(Once you pay off
this debt of 1,000 taels for me)

43
00:02:09,239 --> 00:02:11,400
(and get Mo Yuya hooked
while you're at it,)

44
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:14,519
(then the divorce will be set,)

45
00:02:14,679 --> 00:02:16,079
(and I'll live.)

46
00:02:16,119 --> 00:02:17,920
(After that I can live free and easy,)

47
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,559
(build a business, and make a fortune
in ancient times.)

48
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,560
(Chunya Teahouse)

49
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:33,079
Yuya.

50
00:02:44,679 --> 00:02:45,480
Qingyun?

51
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:47,119
What are you doing here?

52
00:02:47,719 --> 00:02:49,599
I know this isn't proper.

53
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,199
I'm sorry, Yuya.

54
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:54,519
Where is Feng Weiyue?

55
00:02:55,239 --> 00:02:56,840
Is she refusing to pay?

56
00:02:57,559 --> 00:02:58,599
So

57
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,159
she sent you here to plead for her?

58
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,719
No, that's not it.

59
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,199
It has nothing to do with my sister.

60
00:03:03,559 --> 00:03:05,079
I came here on my own.

61
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,039
Weiyue said

62
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:10,400
you two are only 1,000 taels
away from divorce.

63
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,320
She doesn't have a coin.

64
00:03:13,079 --> 00:03:15,480
This is all the savings
I've built up over the years.

65
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,360
I'm willing

66
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,039
to pay it for her.

67
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:23,440
Yuya,

68
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:25,800
if you divorce Weiyue,

69
00:03:26,239 --> 00:03:27,960
could we go back to how we...

70
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,119
Qingyun,

71
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:31,079
I'm not the right man for you.

72
00:03:31,559 --> 00:03:32,960
What we had is in the past.

73
00:03:34,119 --> 00:03:35,039
You deserve someone better.

74
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,559
No.

75
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:40,679
I don't want anyone else.
I only want you.

76
00:03:49,559 --> 00:03:50,440
Qingyun...

77
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:54,559
I'm actually gravely ill
and don't have long to live.

78
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,880
With this broken body of mine,

79
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:58,880
could you still love me?

80
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,320
(How?)

81
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:01,360
(How could this be?)

82
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,840
We can seek doctors and medicine.

83
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:04,400
Someone must be able to...

84
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,039
I've already sought every famous doctor
in the world.

85
00:04:06,679 --> 00:04:08,320
None of them could do anything.

86
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:09,880
No.

87
00:04:10,159 --> 00:04:11,159
It can't be.

88
00:04:11,519 --> 00:04:12,599
How could that be?

89
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,440
Yuya,

90
00:04:15,079 --> 00:04:17,280
do you really want to have nothing to do
with me so badly

91
00:04:17,559 --> 00:04:20,159
that you'd make up such a lie to
curse yourself just to deceive me?

92
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,800
Why is it so noisy downstairs?

93
00:04:29,239 --> 00:04:29,840
Your Highness,

94
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,199
it's the princess consort.

95
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:34,400
She seems to be selling something called
mineral water and instant noodles.

96
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,079
There's quite a crowd.

97
00:04:36,199 --> 00:04:37,280
Should we go take a look?

98
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,159
Huh?

99
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:54,039
What's this?

100
00:04:54,039 --> 00:04:55,480
Hey, come take a look, everyone.

101
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,000
What is this?

102
00:04:56,079 --> 00:04:56,599
And you can drink it?

103
00:04:56,599 --> 00:04:57,199
Never seen it before.

104
00:04:57,199 --> 00:04:57,960
Don't rush.

105
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:58,719
Everyone gets one.

106
00:04:59,239 --> 00:05:01,239
Instant noodles, like the name says,

107
00:05:01,599 --> 00:05:03,639
just add boiling water,

108
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:07,400
and you'll get a steaming bowl

109
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,039
of pure deliciousness.

110
00:05:11,159 --> 00:05:11,800
I'll take a bowl.

111
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,519
That'll be 20 wen.

112
00:05:13,599 --> 00:05:14,599
Anyone else want some?

113
00:05:14,599 --> 00:05:16,119
Me too. Give me one.

114
00:05:16,119 --> 00:05:17,079
One for me too.

115
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:18,639
I'll take one too.

116
00:05:18,639 --> 00:05:19,480
Give me one bowl.

117
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,599
One for me.

118
00:05:20,599 --> 00:05:21,480
Don't rush.

119
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,280
Take a seat, anywhere you like.

120
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,960
Don't worry if you haven't got one.

121
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,320
We still have some in stock.

122
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,679
Prepare them the way I showed you,

123
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:30,800
and they'll be just as delicious.

124
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,119
Still only 20 wen.

125
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,840
Plus, you get

126
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:36,159
a bottle of cool, sweet mineral water
on the house.

127
00:05:36,159 --> 00:05:37,280
Who's interested?

128
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,639
Me! I want it!

129
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,760
I'll take this one.

130
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:40,880
Give me this.

131
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:44,719
Smells amazing.

132
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,679
Neglecting her duty.

133
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,400
Two packs left.

134
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,280
Anyone want them?

135
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,880
Me! Give this one to me!

136
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:54,880
Looks like you've made quite a profit.

137
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:55,760
Of cour...

138
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:07,519
What do you mean?

139
00:06:07,519 --> 00:06:10,119
I just borrowed your teahouse
to do some business.

140
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:11,440
Is that illegal?

141
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:12,639
It's not illegal.

142
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,159
But just now,

143
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,960
didn't you drink a cup of tea,
my princess consort?

144
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:18,360
You haven't paid for it yet.

145
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,000
That's it?

146
00:06:20,599 --> 00:06:21,239
How much?

147
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,280
I'll pay you back.

148
00:06:22,519 --> 00:06:23,039
Pei Chen.

149
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:30,160
(Tea Price List: 1,000 Taels)

150
00:06:31,119 --> 00:06:32,079
What?

151
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:35,679
A thousand taels for one cup of tea?

152
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:36,679
What...

153
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,440
You're so generous.

154
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:42,920
Another 500 taels for my teahouse.

155
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:45,360
I...

156
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,760
Pei Chen,

157
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:51,800
she now owes me a total of 2,500 taels.

158
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:55,639
All right.

159
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,039
How did it go?

160
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,320
How was your talk?

161
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,960
Why did he suddenly pick on me?

162
00:07:11,599 --> 00:07:12,480
Feng Weiyue,

163
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:14,119
were you just trying to mock me?

164
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:17,800
You're so proud of winning Yuya's heart,
aren't you?

165
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:19,320
You wanted to show off to me

166
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,599
and take the chance to laugh at me,
right?

167
00:07:21,239 --> 00:07:22,199
You should know

168
00:07:22,199 --> 00:07:23,760
you stole this relationship.

169
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:25,159
You'll rot in hell!

170
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,519
(Oh dear.)

171
00:07:27,719 --> 00:07:30,159
(How come the more I try
to match them up, the angrier she gets?)

172
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:31,760
Hey, wait.

173
00:07:32,079 --> 00:07:34,519
I don't know what happened
between you two just now,

174
00:07:34,679 --> 00:07:37,480
but you and him are a perfect match.

175
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,800
Made for each other.

176
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,079
As women,

177
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:42,199
if we like something,
we have to have it.

178
00:07:43,119 --> 00:07:44,400
Since the soft approach didn't work,

179
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,440
let's try the hard way.

180
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:47,360
Let's go.

181
00:07:48,159 --> 00:07:48,679
(Chunya Teahouse)
Hey.

182
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:49,920
Right, your leg.

183
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:51,119
Easy.

184
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,480
So you finally decided to come back,
my dear?

185
00:08:01,559 --> 00:08:02,199
Oh, well,

186
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:03,679
Your Highness,

187
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,920
I already wrote you a divorce letter.

188
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,480
So stop calling me that.

189
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,760
As long as I don't stamp it,

190
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:11,760
we're still husband and wife.

191
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:15,199
Just tell me, what do you want?

192
00:08:18,039 --> 00:08:19,199
What do I want?

193
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,520
Your beauty?

194
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,000
You don't seem to have that.

195
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:31,920
Then it must be money.

196
00:08:32,359 --> 00:08:34,359
You owe me 2,500 taels.

197
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,479
The debt isn't paid off yet.

198
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:39,039
I can't bear to part with you.

199
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,319
This is robbery!

200
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:46,159
A lousy cup of tea and a lousy cup,

201
00:08:46,159 --> 00:08:47,319
and you want 1,500 taels?

202
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:49,479
Didn't you teach me this?

203
00:08:50,079 --> 00:08:53,840
That teacup happens to be
a favorite of mine.

204
00:08:55,439 --> 00:08:56,039
(Humph.)

205
00:08:56,479 --> 00:08:58,279
(We'll see how much you like it
in a moment.)

206
00:08:58,279 --> 00:08:58,920
Fine.

207
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:00,880
You're ruthless.

208
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,079
Once

209
00:09:02,319 --> 00:09:05,039
our marriage debt is settled,
we can divorce, right?

210
00:09:05,439 --> 00:09:06,119
Naturally.

211
00:09:07,079 --> 00:09:08,640
I'll pay you back 2,500 taels.

212
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:10,920
Fine, I'll pay.

213
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:12,920
It's just 2,500 taels.

214
00:09:24,239 --> 00:09:25,800
Your Highness, then it's settled.

215
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,479
Let's drink a cup of tea
in place of wine.

216
00:09:29,199 --> 00:09:30,000
Cheers.

217
00:09:52,279 --> 00:09:56,119
Do you feel a little dizzy?

218
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:03,239
2,500 taels.

219
00:10:03,399 --> 00:10:04,880
Yeah, we agreed.

220
00:10:06,439 --> 00:10:08,399
Once I pay back 2,500 taels,

221
00:10:09,239 --> 00:10:11,199
we'll divorce.

222
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:12,600
What is this?

223
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:15,640
(You're ruthless.)

224
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:19,800
(Once our marriage debt is settled,
we can divorce, right?)

225
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:21,000
(Naturally.)

226
00:10:22,199 --> 00:10:23,720
(I'll pay you back 2,500 taels.)

227
00:10:24,439 --> 00:10:26,399
There's actually such a strange thing
in this world.

228
00:10:28,439 --> 00:10:29,479
Could it be

229
00:10:30,319 --> 00:10:32,479
that Xingzhao Pavilion
targeted Feng Weiyue

230
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,960
because she has some rare treasure
on her?

231
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,600
Feng Weiyue.

232
00:10:41,239 --> 00:10:42,000
Feng Weiyue!

233
00:10:46,479 --> 00:10:48,880
My lady, we've been waiting
for six hours.

234
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:50,479
Maybe we should just go back.

235
00:10:52,439 --> 00:10:54,199
(Feng Weiyue, you played me again!)

236
00:10:56,159 --> 00:10:57,479
(I won't go soft again.)

237
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:17,480
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

238
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:20,000
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

239
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:24,040
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

240
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:26,840
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

241
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:30,840
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

242
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:33,640
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

243
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:39,240
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

244
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,520
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

245
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:47,840
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

246
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,640
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

247
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:54,200
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

248
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:58,360
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

249
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:01,080
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

250
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:03,000
♪This love remains unchanged♪

251
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:06,520
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

252
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,680
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

253
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:14,800
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

254
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:17,560
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

255
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,500
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

256
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:21,200
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

257
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:24,560
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

258
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:28,880
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

259
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:31,240
♪I don't regret that vow♪

260
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:34,720
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
